cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MLIP Studio, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "MLIP Studio"
abstract: >-
  MLIP Studio is an open platform for interactive benchmarking and simulations
  using machine learning interatomic potentials (MLIPs). It brings more than 60
  pretrained universal MLIPs into a single graphical interface and a Python API,
  so users can evaluate structures, compare models, run common simulation tasks,
  and benchmark against reference data for molecules and materials.
